{"id":"la.sample.1","kp":"la.det.calc","qtype":"fill","statement_md":"设 $A=\\begin{pmatrix} 2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 4 \\end{pmatrix}$，求 $|A|$。","answer_sympy":"5","analysis":"二阶行列式按主对角线减副对角线，2·4−1·3=5。"}
{"id":"la.sample.2","kp":"la.det.calc","qtype":"fill","statement_md":"设 $B=\\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 6 \\end{pmatrix}$（上三角阵），求 $|B|$。","answer_sympy":"24","analysis":"上三角行列式等于主对角线元素之积，1×4×6=24。"}
{"id":"la.sample.3","kp":"la.det.abstract","qtype":"fill","statement_md":"设 $A$ 为 3 阶矩阵且 $|A|=4$，求 $|2A|$。","answer_sympy":"32","analysis":"数乘行列式 $|kA|=k^n|A|$，n=3，故 $|2A|=2^3·4=32$。"}
{"id":"la.sample.4","kp":"la.matrix.inv","qtype":"fill","statement_md":"设 $A=\\begin{pmatrix} 2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 \\end{pmatrix}$，求 $A^{-1}$。","answer_sympy":"Matrix([[1, -1], [-1, 2]])","analysis":"二阶逆用伴随矩阵法，先算 $|A|=1$，故 $A^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix} 1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 2 \\end{pmatrix}$。"}
{"id":"la.sample.5","kp":"la.matrix.inv","qtype":"fill","statement_md":"设 $A=\\begin{pmatrix} 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4 \\end{pmatrix}$，求 $A^{-1}$。","answer_sympy":"Matrix([[Rational(1,2), 0, 0], [0, Rational(1,3), 0], [0, 0, Rational(1,4)]])","analysis":"对角阵之逆为对角元取倒数，故 $A^{-1}=\\operatorname{diag}(1/2,1/3,1/4)$。"}
{"id":"la.sample.6","kp":"la.matrix.rank","qtype":"fill","statement_md":"设 $A=\\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 4 & 6 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 \\end{pmatrix}$，求 $r(A)$。","answer_sympy":"2","analysis":"第二行为第一行 2 倍，经初等行变换得阶梯型两段非零行，故 $r(A)=2$。"}
{"id":"la.sample.7","kp":"la.eigen","qtype":"fill","statement_md":"设 $A=\\begin{pmatrix} 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3 \\end{pmatrix}$，求属于特征值 $\\lambda=2$ 的一个特征向量（首分量取 1）。","answer_sympy":"Matrix([[1], [0]])","analysis":"解 $(A-2E)x=0$ 得 $x_2=0$、$x_1$ 自由，取 $x_1=1$ 得特征向量 $(1,0)^T$。"}
{"id":"la.sample.8","kp":"la.vector.group","qtype":"fill","statement_md":"设向量组 $\\alpha_1=(1,0,0),\\ \\alpha_2=(0,1,0),\\ \\alpha_3=(1,1,0)$，求该向量组的秩。","answer_sympy":"2","analysis":"三向量均落在 $z=0$ 平面内，且 $\\alpha_3=\\alpha_1+\\alpha_2$，极大无关组含 2 个，故秩为 2。"}
